GIVEN a IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`an amount in agorot rounded to the nearest ten shekels` MEANS
    a - (a MODULO 1000) + (IF (a MODULO 1000) AT LEAST 500 THEN 1000 ELSE 0)

GIVEN r IS A `A per-person rate`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the rate the Law prints is what rounding it to the nearest ten shekels gives` MEANS
    r's `the Law prints, in agorot` EQUALS `an amount in agorot rounded to the nearest ten shekels` (r's `the Law prints, in agorot`)

GIVEN r IS A `A per-person rate`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the rate the notice prints is what rounding it to the nearest ten shekels gives` MEANS
    r's `the notice of 7 October 2026 prints, in agorot` EQUALS `an amount in agorot rounded to the nearest ten shekels` (r's `the notice of 7 October 2026 prints, in agorot`)

-- The notice's own reading: the sanction is the rate times the number of persons, and the result is rounded.
GIVEN r IS A `A per-person rate`
      persons IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the sanction in agorot, rounded after the multiplication` MEANS
    `an amount in agorot rounded to the nearest ten shekels` (r's `the notice of 7 October 2026 prints, in agorot` TIMES persons)

`rate: 50 shekels, section 23כו(ג)(1)` MEANS
    `A per-person rate` WITH
        `what the rate is for` IS "section 23כו(ג)(1), the first rate"
        `the Law prints, in agorot` IS 5000
        `the notice of 7 October 2026 prints, in agorot` IS 5118
        `the Law's figure was read from` IS `the consolidation only`
        `the notice's figure was read from` IS `the official instrument, read from its page image`

