    `A per-person rate` WITH
        `what the rate is for` IS "section 23כו(ד)(1), the first rate"
        `the Law prints, in agorot` IS 200
        `the notice of 7 October 2026 prints, in agorot` IS 205
        `the Law's figure was read from` IS `the consolidation only`
        `the notice's figure was read from` IS `the official instrument, read from its page image`

